- transcribe-cpp 0.2.2: MIT
- @picovoice/pvrecorder-node 1.2.9: Apache-2.0
- @lydell/node-pty 1.2.0-beta.15: MIT
- sherpa-onnx-node 1.13.8: Apache-2.0

Speech voices are Piper models distributed by the sherpa-onnx project:
https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/tag/tts-models
Their upstream MODEL_CARD and espeak-ng data remain in the downloaded archive.
The default Siwis model card credits the SIWIS dataset (CC-BY 4.0):
https://datashare.is.ed.ac.uk/handle/10283/2353

Model weights are not bundled. Each upstream model repository defines its
own license. Models are downloaded only after confirmation or with --yes.
